---
const recordingUrl = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/animated-neuron/recording.json`;
---
<figure class="neuron-replay-figure">
  <snnlab-neuron-replay data-recording-url={recordingUrl}>
    <div class="replay-scene" role="img" aria-label="Recorded neuron: blue input pulses travel towards a membrane-voltage gauge; pink output pulses mark recorded spikes. A scrolling voltage trace shows the threshold and resets.">
      <p class="replay-status" role="status">Loading recorded neuron…</p>
    </div>
    <div class="replay-controls" aria-label="Neuron recording playback">
      <button type="button" data-play disabled>Play</button>
      <button type="button" data-replay disabled>Replay</button>
      <label class="speed-control">Speed
        <select data-speed disabled aria-label="Playback speed">
          <option value="0.5">0.5×</option>
          <option value="1" selected>1×</option>
          <option value="2">2×</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label class="scrub-control"><span>Time</span><input type="range" data-scrub min="0" max="360" step="0.25" value="0" disabled aria-label="Recording time in milliseconds" /><output data-time>0.00 / 360 ms</output></label>
    </div>
    <p class="replay-description">Precomputed snnlab recording, not a live simulation. Blue shows membrane voltage and incoming current pulses; pink marks threshold and emitted spikes. Pulse travel is schematic. Playback controls change only how the recording is viewed.</p>
    <noscript>JavaScript is needed to view the recording. Current pulses raise membrane voltage from −65 mV; between pulses it leaks towards rest. Reaching −50 mV emits a spike and resets the voltage to −65 mV.</noscript>
  </snnlab-neuron-replay>
  <figcaption>Recorded neuron receiving current pulses. Blue shows recorded post-reset voltage; pink marks spikes at the −50 mV threshold. Threshold points mark events, not measured pre-reset voltage. Rest and reset are −65 mV; pulse motion is schematic.</figcaption>
</figure>
<script>
  import './neuron-replay';
</script>
<style>
  .neuron-replay-figure { margin: 1.5rem 0; }
  snnlab-neuron-replay { container-type: inline-size; --replay-blue: #176d91; --replay-pink: #bc3866; --replay-ink: #263343; --replay-grid: #d6dfe7; --replay-bg: #fff; display: block; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--replay-grid); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--replay-bg); color: var(--replay-ink); }
  :global(.dark) snnlab-neuron-replay, :global([data-theme='dark']) snnlab-neuron-replay { --replay-blue: #70c3ec; --replay-pink: #f38db2; --replay-ink: #e2e8f0; --replay-grid: #435263; --replay-bg: #151c25; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :global(html:not(.light):not([data-theme='light'])) snnlab-neuron-replay { --replay-blue: #70c3ec; --replay-pink: #f38db2; --replay-ink: #e2e8f0; --replay-grid: #435263; --replay-bg: #151c25; }
  }
  .replay-scene { height: 310px; width: 100%; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .replay-scene :global(canvas) { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  .replay-scene :global(.replay-labels) { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; font: 13px/1.3 system-ui, sans-serif; }
  .replay-scene :global(.replay-label) { position: absolute; white-space: nowrap; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); color: var(--replay-ink); }
  .replay-scene :global(.replay-label.blue) { color: var(--replay-blue); }
  .replay-scene :global(.replay-label.pink) { color: var(--replay-pink); }
  .replay-status { position: absolute; z-index: 1; inset: 0; display: grid; place-content: center; padding: 20px; margin: 0; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; }
  .replay-controls { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--replay-grid); padding-top: 12px; font: 13px/1.4 system-ui, sans-serif; }
  button, select { font: inherit; color: inherit; background: var(--replay-bg); border: 1px solid var(--replay-grid); border-radius: 6px; min-height: 36px; padding: 6px 10px; }
  button { cursor: pointer; min-width: 64px; }
  button:disabled, select:disabled, input:disabled { opacity: .5; cursor: default; }
  button:focus-visible, select:focus-visible, input:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--replay-blue); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .speed-control { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .scrub-control { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex: 1 1 260px; min-width: 0; }
  input[type='range'] { flex: 1; min-width: 40px; width: 100%; accent-color: var(--replay-blue); }
  output { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; min-width: 105px; text-align: right; }
  .replay-description { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; overflow: hidden; clip-path: inset(50%); white-space: nowrap; }
  noscript { display: block; margin-top: 12px; }
  figcaption { margin-top: 12px; color: var(--replay-ink, inherit); font-size: .875rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .replay-status[hidden] { display: none; }
  @container (max-width: 599px) { .replay-scene { height: 470px; } }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .scrub-control { flex-basis: 100%; } }
</style>
